# ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES (READ FIRST - NEVER VIOLATE)

## This is a LOCAL-FIRST app
- NO backend server. NO REST API. NO routes. NO models folder. NO controllers.
- NO authentication. NO login pages. NO user management.
- NO TypeScript (except src/utils/index.ts).
- NO Base44. NO @base44/sdk. NO base44 folder.
- NO cloud services (except Cloudflare for session polls).
- Data lives ONLY in IndexedDB via Dexie.

## Data layer: api.entities.<Name> ONLY
- NEVER access Dexie directly. ALWAYS use api.entities.<Name>.
- Methods: filter, list, get, create, update, delete, deleteMany, aggregate.
- create auto-adds: id, created_date, updated_date, created_by_id, created_by.

## ADD A NEW ENTITY (follow EXACTLY this order)
1. src/api/localClient.js → add name to TABLES array + new db.version(N+1).stores(...)
2. src/lib/campaignDelete.js → add to LINKED_ENTITIES (children before parents)
3. If printable → src/lib/printModel.js, src/components/print/PrintSheet.jsx, src/components/print/PrintButton.jsx, src/lib/editablePdf.js
4. docs-entites/entities/<Name>.jsonc (documentation only)

## NEVER DO THESE (instant failure)
- NEVER create src/models/, src/routes/, src/controllers/, src/services/
- NEVER add authentication or login/logout
- NEVER propose REST endpoints (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE)
- NEVER suggest Express, Fastify, Prisma, Firebase, Supabase
- NEVER use <Tag> component (use <span className="tag">)
- NEVER use navigate(-1) in MobileBackBar (use useTabStacks + openTab)
- NEVER use @lib/... imports (use @/lib/... with slash)

## Page header structure (MANDATORY)
<span className="tag">Label</span>
<h1>Title</h1>
<p>Description</p>
<CampaignSelect />
<PrintButton preset="..." />
<Button>Action</Button>

## Tech stack
React 18, Vite 8, Tailwind 3, shadcn/ui, lucide-react, Dexie, Electron (CommonJS), HashRouter.
JavaScript only (.jsx/.js). Alias @/ for src/.

## Code style
2-space indent, double quotes, semicolons, const by default, early returns.
Functional components with hooks. Default export per file.
console.error in catch blocks (never console.log).

## Windows
PowerShell only. No &&, rm -rf, grep.